# The Go workspace is the shared context for services with local replace
# directives. Keep every module manifest/source file, but omit host artifacts
# and credentials that never participate in a production build.
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

**/bin/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/*.test
**/*.out
**/*.prof
**/*.log
**/tmp/
**/.cache/

.env
.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/keys/

**/README.md
**/docs/
